#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:64
#: 715705ae8b1341d3848c8aec0de8bbc6
msgid "Switching between the two camera inputs, C1 (default on) or C2, and between on (default) and off of Vsw (jumper selectable supply), can be implemented using the Relay function of ArduPilot and assigning the relays to an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch on the transmitter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:66
#: 5c87ef2ad0d644b89ac87b86bad07b79
msgid "Set the ``RELAYx_PIN`` to \"81\" for on/off of Vsw, and to \"82\" to control the camera switching. Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) and set its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate Relay (1-4) that you had set its pin parameter above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:69
#: 52fa8d61770b4b1cb5d123cc63ebd4e5
msgid "For example, use Channel 10 to control the camera switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:71
#: ddae5238dd534dc7b3fac3a37d56b653
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = \"82\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:72
#: d262bdbcef0e436c97c8e75115eab221
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = \"34\" (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:74
#: b1468d89096646c1ab59ff0de81ba566
msgid "setting Relay on/high assigned for Vsw will turn off that supply. Likewise, setting on/high for the Relay assigned for camera, will switch from Camera 1 to Camera 2."
msgstr ""

